# Secrets
#
# Deliberately broad. The narrow version of this list (.env, .env.local,
# .env.*.local) let a file called `.env.mock-backup` be committed with a live
# API key and a per-customer ExternalId in it - see engineering log #26.
# Anything env-shaped is ignored; the example is re-included explicitly.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Project
.scan-cache/
evals/results/
*.local.json
